          "text": "---\n\n**Question 7: AI provider — DeepSeek or OpenRouter?**\n\nThe agents.md specifies **DeepSeek V4 Pro/Flash** via `symfony/ai` throughout — platform config, testing patterns, everything. But you just mentioned **OpenRouter free models** (Gemma 4 31B). \n\nThese are different providers with different APIs, different symfony/ai configurations, and different cost/performance profiles.\n\n**My recommendation: Clarify which goes where.**\n\n| Use case | Provider | Rationale |\n|----------|----------|-----------|\n| Triage interview (main pipeline) | DeepSeek V4 Pro | agents.md already designed for this, medical-quality responses matter |\n| Synthetic case generation | OpenRouter free models | Saves costs on bulk auto-generation, quality less critical |\n\nOr are you switching entirely to OpenRouter for everything? If so, that should be reflected in the agent configuration docs and probably warrants an ADR since it's a significant architecture change from what's documented.\n\n**Which is it?**\n\n\n\n",
