sk a few more edge-case questions and then see if there are any ADR-worthy decisions.\n\nLet me focus on two remaining things:\n1. Error states - what happens when AI fails\n2. Specialist/urgency enums - confirm them\n\nThen I'll check for ADR-worthy decisions.",
