          "text": "---\n\n**Question 10: Character limits per message**\n\nYou mentioned \"character limits for each turn, to avoid bloat.\" This is a domain constraint — what are the limits?\n\n| Field | Recommended limit | Rationale |\n|-------|------------------|-----------|\n| Initial Symptom Description | 500 chars | Enough for a sentence or two, prevents novel-length complaints |\n| User answer (per Turn) | 300 chars | Short answers to AI follow-ups |\n| AI response (question or result) | 1000 chars | AI needs room for justification text |\n\nTotal conversation history max: ~3,900 chars (500 initial + 3 × (300 user + 1000 AI)), well within any LLM context window even with system prompt overhead.\n\n**These numbers work? Or different limits?**\n\n\n\n",
